"access.card.1" = "Multiple studies show that *daily* writing down *five things* you’re grateful for can strengthen your sense of happiness and promote a more positive mindset.";
"access.card.2" = "In a study with *hundreds* of participants, participants who did this scored *12% higher* on well-being (measured across the scale range) than the control group. \n\n |Emmons & McCullough, 2003|";
"access.card.3" = "This method is also mentioned in *Yale University’s* course “|The Science of Well-Being|” as one of the six *low-threshold exercises* that can strongly contribute to greater well-being.";
"access.card.4" = "This is the full list:\n\n• 30 minutes of light movement\n• 10 minutes of meditation\n• *Write down 5 positive things*\n• 1 minute of mindful enjoyment\n• 1 new social interaction\n• 1 act of kindness";
"access.card.5" = "This app is built with respect for your *privacy* and makes things easier. There are no premium options; a symbolic contribution of *€5* (or your local equivalent) to support development is completely *optional*.";
